            "text": "theorem time_chain_coefficient {q : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q)\n    (b h η X F FX Fη : ℝ) :\n    b * q ^ (b - 1) * qTime h η * F +\n        q ^ b * (FX * xTime q h η X + Fη * etaTime q h η) =\n      q ^ (b - 1) * timeCoeff b h η X F FX Fη"
